\b 2. Device control and safety\b0\par
This software controls touch, pen, and keyboard hardware and coordinates switching between EGoTouchRev and HuaweiTHP. Do not forcibly terminate either provider while a switch is in progress. Save ongoing work before first installation or an update. If touch becomes temporarily unavailable, use a keyboard or mouse and restart Windows.\par
